          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

JSON Schema for SKOS Collection and OrderedCollection in JSON-LD form. A Collection is a meaningful grouping of concepts; an OrderedCollection preserves member ordering via the JSON-LD @list construct. Based on the W3C SKOS Reference (https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/).
:title: "SKOS Collection"
:union: ``anyOf``</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.skosProperties.skosCollection.CollectionProfile"/>
        </ownedComment>
